{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-28T20:11:03.784Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"53336ddfb421186143d8d480","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-28T20:11:03.783Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Synthetic diagnosis confirms that complete-list evidence can reuse a clipped extension field after compact mutation output: a legacy checkpoint read was 241 characters while an unbounded point read returned all 22123 persisted characters. Added one shared complete field reader for hydration, compare-and-set checkpoint checks and garbage-collection marking. Corpus certification remains in place, all recovery assertions are retained, and old inline data stays supported. The regression creates and claims a legacy inline checkpoint through the real SDK, then checks load, migration and collection. No SDK mock, retry or timeout increase is introduced."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-28T20:11:03.784Z"}],"before_hash":"caeabce661c3e8828d177fa29a7a0f2e4c8011d2034fdbc382ad6886a4fa68ec","after_hash":"26410c15d289a8000ca95981bc1f23e1b1c339f83f20c41a49bd84b4332fa21d","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"3a663bd8b99c204b19c9ae6c85b75010dd257cb970c36b51a808ca8455112d39"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-28T20:17:05.663Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"53336ddfb421186143d8d480","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-28T20:17:05.662Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Diagnosis correction: the 241-character read was the historical get(at=1, fields=rlm_state), not the certified complete-list read. The direct current read was the full 22123 characters. The root cause is the historical get default output budget. Discarded the uncommitted broad point-read workaround. The focused production fix only requests unbounded output for the existing historical checkpoint read and validates its result envelope. Current list reads, compare-and-set checks and GC stay on their existing paths. The new regression explicitly reads a large legacy checkpoint at history version 1, then verifies lazy migration and GC."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-28T20:17:05.663Z"}],"before_hash":"26410c15d289a8000ca95981bc1f23e1b1c339f83f20c41a49bd84b4332fa21d","after_hash":"ec97d7f8865a8aaa256e31be6a227a42e8da259c293a0afb7355885e7be9d4fa","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"5bf8a2c21689aa34a8f9ce08efa9f16f99f8a626c5b506b9d9242ee3d31e7763"}
